=== PE 897: Connected Prime Squares ===

Problem: N×N grid, cell (i,j) marked if i²+j² is prime.
Find connected components of marked cells (4-directional).

Key properties:
  - i²+j² is prime: relates to Gaussian primes (i+ji in Z[i])
  - Symmetry: grid is symmetric about main diagonal
  - For large N, most primes of form a²+b² are Gaussian primes

Prime density of i²+j²:
  N= 5: density=0.4400
  N=10: density=0.3300
  N=15: density=0.2622
  N=20: density=0.2475
  N=25: density=0.2256

PE answer: 1.599827123
